    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Cult of Blood",
    "summary": "As [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you can pick an Idols of Khorne ability below. It is active for your **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** and **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** units until your next Command phase. You can pick each ability only once per battle.\n\nEach ability is an aura of the model with a range of 6\", or 9\" if the model is **TITANIC**, and your **JAKHALS** and **GOREMONGERS** units in range get its effect:\n\n- **Idol of Infinite Rage (Aura)**: their attacks get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) and +1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).\n- **Idol of Burning Wrath (Aura)**: their models get +1\" M, and the unit gets +1 to its [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).\n- **Idol of Blessed Blood (Aura)**: their models get a 4+ [invulnerable save](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls).",
